1
00:00:00,114 --> 00:00:02,014
(Sheldon:)Are you trying to soothe me

2
00:00:02,016 --> 00:00:04,646
by singing the Star Trek
theme as a lullaby?

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,650
(Raj(singing):)Yes.

4
00:00:06,654 --> 00:00:09,254
(Sheldon:)I'm not a child,
don't do that.

5
00:00:09,257 --> 00:00:10,987
(Bernadette:)Sorry.

6
00:00:14,729 --> 00:00:18,169
Do you know 2001:
A Space Odyssey?

7
00:00:29,143 --> 00:00:30,813
All right, now
that's soothing.

8
00:00:39,821 --> 00:00:42,791
Look, I-I get it,
this is still my room;

9
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,490
(Leonard:)we haven't really
made it yours.

10
00:00:44,492 --> 00:00:45,722
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

11
00:00:45,726 --> 00:00:47,456
(Leonard:)Which is why I got you

12
00:00:47,462 --> 00:00:50,262
(Leonard:)this Pink Power Ranger.

13
00:00:51,232 --> 00:00:53,132
(Leonard:)Put it anywhere you like.

14
00:00:53,134 --> 00:00:57,024
(Penny:)Okay, but you may feel
some discomfort.

